  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="05fabdc5-d5d0-52f3-86be-86ecc6528e0a" activityNameId="b3a5f0bc-f0c1-5e69-a3b2-3bc17ae40b1f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, production LY, at long-distance pipeline</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, production LY, at long-distance pipeline
In 2019 100% of the imported Libyan natural gas to RER was imported by pipeline and 0% as LNG. An average distance of 520 km is estimated for the pipeline export from Libyan Arab Jamahiriya, of which are 520 km offshore pipeline. The estimated shipping distance for LNG are 11700 km.;
d2b40d76-29bc-3db2-ba50-c3c6f97fbeac
This dataset describes the transport needed for an average export of Libyan natural gas. Gas losses and emissions during seasonal storage are included.
Location:  The data for storage emissions are based on global data. The amount of gas stored is a rough estimate based on European data. The average weighted transport distance is based on the trade movements 2019.
Technology: The distance is an European average based on the European long-distance pipeline network and LNG shipping routes.
Time period: Transport modes investigated for 2019.
Production volume: none
Sampling: Literature. Online calculators for distances.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d2b40d76-29bc-3db2-ba50-c3c6f97fbeac.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
